@startuml
title Reviews Wall UI - State Machine

[*] --> Closed
Closed --> Opening : open()
Opening --> ListLoading
ListLoading --> ListReady : success
ListLoading --> Error : error

ListReady --> Filtering : filter_change
Filtering --> ListLoading

ListReady --> LoadingMore : load_more
LoadingMore --> ListReady
LoadingMore --> Error

ListReady --> Form : open_form
Form --> Submitting : submit
Submitting --> ThankYou : success
Submitting --> FormError : error
FormError --> Form
ThankYou --> ListReady : back_to_list

ListReady --> HowVerified : open_policy
HowVerified --> ListReady : back

ListReady --> Closed : close()
Error --> Closed : close()

@enduml
